<title>BELGIUM: EU cuts distant high quality wheat import duty.</title>
<headline>EU cuts distant high quality wheat import duty.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union import duties on transatlantic imports of high quality soft wheat will on Friday be cut to 13.33 Ecus a tonne, from 18.96 Ecus, the European Commission said.</p>
<p>Import duties on other varieties of cereals are unchanged.  </p>
